    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941690/extras/e23c1ebf6ceab1fd2c83ffed249d5f8b.poster.avif?t=1701546406\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941690/extras/e23c1ebf6ceab1fd2c83ffed249d5f8b.webm?t=1701546406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941690/extras/e23c1ebf6ceab1fd2c83ffed249d5f8b.mp4?t=1701546406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Cyberference is an old school first person shooter. You won't find weapon load outs or regenerating health here. Instead you'll have to find your weapons and health pickups. Cyberference keeps things simple and keeps the action coming! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941690/extras/f579e32d471b1c7344cb7e5afbc99a13.poster.avif?t=1701546406\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941690/extras/f579e32d471b1c7344cb7e5afbc99a13.webm?t=1701546406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941690/extras/f579e32d471b1c7344cb7e5afbc99a13.mp4?t=1701546406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2>When the player runs across a terrorist organization, it isn't enough for him to just save the day then and there. Instead, you have to hunt this organization down and find its leader. This will lead you to interfere with one of civilization's greatest threats, a virus that takes control of robots!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A story mode that can be played in single player or cooperatively.<br></li><li>Arcade mode where players race to get the most kills<br></li><li>Vs. Mode where players fight against each other.<br></li><li>Local Multiplayer supporting 4 players<br></li><li>Split screen or Dual Monitor Support<br></li><li>Various weapons such as a shotgun, sniper rifle, and grenade launcher.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dual Monitor Support</h2><br>If you have two displays connected to your computer than you can utilize both of them in multiplayer. Rather than sharing a screen with a friend, the game will devote one screen to each player, bringing the most out of the local multiplayer experience.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941690/extras/22c3ccb133457ae845ac4cd8c712130b.avif?t=1701546406\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941690/extras/e23c1ebf6ceab1fd2c83ffed249d5f8b.poster.avif?t=1701546406\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941690/extras/e23c1ebf6ceab1fd2c83ffed249d5f8b.webm?t=1701546406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941690/extras/e23c1ebf6ceab1fd2c83ffed249d5f8b.mp4?t=1701546406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Cyberference is an old school first person shooter. You won't find weapon load outs or regenerating health here. Instead you'll have to find your weapons and health pickups. Cyberference keeps things simple and keeps the action coming! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941690/extras/f579e32d471b1c7344cb7e5afbc99a13.poster.avif?t=1701546406\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941690/extras/f579e32d471b1c7344cb7e5afbc99a13.webm?t=1701546406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941690/extras/f579e32d471b1c7344cb7e5afbc99a13.mp4?t=1701546406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2>When the player runs across a terrorist organization, it isn't enough for him to just save the day then and there. Instead, you have to hunt this organization down and find its leader. This will lead you to interfere with one of civilization's greatest threats, a virus that takes control of robots!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A story mode that can be played in single player or cooperatively.<br></li><li>Arcade mode where players race to get the most kills<br></li><li>Vs. Mode where players fight against each other.<br></li><li>Local Multiplayer supporting 4 players<br></li><li>Split screen or Dual Monitor Support<br></li><li>Various weapons such as a shotgun, sniper rifle, and grenade launcher.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dual Monitor Support</h2><br>If you have two displays connected to your computer than you can utilize both of them in multiplayer. Rather than sharing a screen with a friend, the game will devote one screen to each player, bringing the most out of the local multiplayer experience.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941690/extras/22c3ccb133457ae845ac4cd8c712130b.avif?t=1701546406\" /></div>",
